{"4875270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ASCEND.exe", "steam_appid": 4875270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Psychological horror meets &quot;facility&quot; management.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ASCEND.exe</strong> is a retro-horror management game built around a single, unsettling question: why does the facility never stop expanding?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875270/extras/bcc8ec3a752e3283566967682c3dd957.poster.avif?t=1788253964\" aria-label=\"Clip of entering an elevator, with a monster chasing close behind\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875270/extras/bcc8ec3a752e3283566967682c3dd957.webm?t=1788253964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875270/extras/bcc8ec3a752e3283566967682c3dd957.mp4?t=1788253964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover your true purpose.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the latest operator of a research facility buried deep underground. During the day, attach nodes, manage resources, keep production running.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875270/extras/80a59029f2af19fe17cc328593170322.poster.avif?t=1788253964\" aria-label=\"Clip of Combining Nodes\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875270/extras/80a59029f2af19fe17cc328593170322.webm?t=1788253964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875270/extras/80a59029f2af19fe17cc328593170322.mp4?t=1788253964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the old facility.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the dark, something in the abandoned sections is still active. Hide from it, run from it, learn from the mistakes of the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875270/extras/19a3cef6813c8a12bf356e3d704de421.poster.avif?t=1788253964\" aria-label=\"Clip of a maze with a giant timer and tall monster\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875270/extras/19a3cef6813c8a12bf356e3d704de421.webm?t=1788253964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875270/extras/19a3cef6813c8a12bf356e3d704de421.mp4?t=1788253964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Node-based construction with upgrade, merge, and adjacency mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro CRT visual aesthetic with stylised horror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A facility that reveals its history as you build deeper into it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mature content: jump scares, disturbing imagery, occult themes, psychedelic visuals.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875270/extras/7bcb56c9c67ed80fcbbc21d3c7de920a.poster.avif?t=1788253964\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://sha